    \textbf{GEN-3 volume hierarchy:}
    \begin{itemize}\setlength\itemsep{2pt}
      \item \texttt{WorldLV} $\supset$ \texttt{BarLV} (EJ-230)
      \item \texttt{BarLV} surrounded by \texttt{AirGapLV} (0.10 mm each side)
