      \item Explicit \textbf{Mylar reflector} ($0.05\mm$) outside air
      \item Bar$\to$air: \texttt{CreateBarSurface()} — \texttt{dielectric\_dielectric, polished} → natural Fresnel + TIR for $\theta>\theta_c$
